<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong July air cargo by region.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong July air cargo by region.</headline>
<byline>Jim Gilchrist</byline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong civil aviation department statistics show cargo handled in July totalled by region rose by 1.6 per cent compared with the same month last year. Air cargo imports on both scheduled and non scheduled flights reached 62,714 tonnes and 68,328 tonnes for exports.</p>
<p>Regional figures (rounded) in tonnes are shown in the table below.</p>
<p>			 JULY 1996 - ALL FLIGHTS</p>
<p>			    Unloaded    Loaded     Pct change from</p>
<p>							   July 1995 for</p>
<p>							   all cargo</p>
<p>Africa			 175.7	 278.7    28.9</p>
<p>Asia -others	     4,115.2     4,942.8     7.3</p>
<p>Australasia		3,080.9     2,959.1    -1.6</p>
<p>Continental Europe    10,413.3     9,079.2     1.6</p>
<p>Japan			5,941.6    11,272.3    -6.8</p>
<p>Mainland China	   1,724.5     2,894.7     5.3</p>
<p>Middle East		  664.3     1,227.7   -11.7</p>
<p>S.E.Asia		  17,564.4    10,389.7     2.4</p>
<p>South America	   67,675	51,864     -33.6</p>
<p>Taiwan		     9,198.5     6,085.6     6.1</p>
<p>UK			   3,660.6     3,719.0    12.6</p>
<p>USA/Canada		 6,230.1    15,469.3     0.7</p>
<p>Total		     62,826.9    68,360.4     1.65</p>
<p>- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
